p&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c91c71b09b475d2b9fb4c0bdff4207c9 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、Syu-San。期限を延長する必要がある場合に備えて、事前に送ったリクエストを再送します！\n\n雨の日、傘をさしているか、傘をさしていないか、どちらかのポーズで描いていただけませんか？ポーズは2つ用意しましたが、好きなポーズを選んでください！\n\n前髪を少し長めにして、左目が一部隠れるように描いてください。彼女は笑わないので、表情はニュートラルか暗い感じでお願いします！\n\nありがとうございました\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Mhsp6dgrUOpv7E9ktqlmE7ejqR8-wdK3?usp=sharing\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Mhsp6dgrUOpv7E9ktqlmE7ejqR8-wdK3?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@syuu_NL/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a92043aa/uploads/origins/b745dd27-d8e3-4f9e-b6c2-880ac4e95496?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2212d6dd9bcf940bd81843f39345a7f5", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a92043aa/uploads/origins/b745dd27-d8e3-4f9e-b6c2-880ac4e95496?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2212d6dd9bcf940bd81843f39345a7f5, https://si.imgix.net/a92043aa/uploads/origins/b745dd27-d8e3-4f9e-b6c2-880ac4e95496?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=82cd013ec7f0793515b6e79829122d24 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a92043aa/uploads/origins/b745dd27-d8e3-4f9e-b6c2-880ac4e95496?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a99d78f0ec85681b1bc9758e57b3d549 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I really liked the previous illustration you did for me. I was hoping to request for you to draw my Vtuber character again in another outfit!\n\nPlease draw her in a cute pose! I will leave the details up to you.\n\nIf possible, I would like a transparent png file of the drawing as well for use on social media (Twitter, Twitch, Youtube), but it is not required.\n\nThank you very much! I would be very happy if you drew her again.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1YBgKs1sBys8eswx-Tk-dG2XFgx5wjg7l", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@syuu_NL/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/0e0b0c4d/uploads/origins/6718d5e5-5fc4-4c31-88f9-a6cf372f74a5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=37a3eb61a73c64c9b006b8a8172455df", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0e0b0c4d/uploads/origins/6718d5e5-5fc4-4c31-88f9-a6cf372f74a5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=37a3eb61a73c64c9b006b8a8172455df, https://si.imgix.net/0e0b0c4d/uploads/origins/6718d5e5-5fc4-4c31-88f9-a6cf372f74a5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a1359565aa86aae8cfb20860afd05070 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0e0b0c4d/uploads/origins/6718d5e5-5fc4-4c31-88f9-a6cf372f74a5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ce263226a3148fce4a2eadc878056789 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！前回描いていただいた2枚のイラストがとても気に入りました。\n\nかっこいいポーズやかわいいポーズでお願いしたいです。\n\nもしよろしければ、SNSやtwitchで紹介させていただきます。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1vW9pv3N51Ky3nFtN9Cwy7jcgH02aSGFM?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@syuu_NL/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c200c37c/uploads/origins/a0ba1c12-38fa-42fd-a17b-ebbd018b6b8a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2db5cdfd2b369afe7c1f5f2a275c8ccb", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c200c37c/uploads/origins/a0ba1c12-38fa-42fd-a17b-ebbd018b6b8a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2db5cdfd2b369afe7c1f5f2a275c8ccb, https://si.imgix.net/c200c37c/uploads/origins/a0ba1c12-38fa-42fd-a17b-ebbd018b6b8a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b63d506d80445bdbd12574979d1591f9 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c200c37c/uploads/origins/a0ba1c12-38fa-42fd-a17b-ebbd018b6b8a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=75f3f5a0f5f656e7c66f2a1010ddba12 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! It's nice to meet you. I saw the illustrations you did for my friend AeryStorm and I was very impressed! I love the beautiful colors in your illustration.\n\nI would like to make a request for you to draw my Vtuber Character in her Anniversary dress. She is a mermaid princess, and she has seashell pupils in her eyes. She is cheerful, but not very smart. She is also a yumejoshi and she loves games, anime, and manga! I would be very happy if you drew her!\n\nIf possible, I would like a transparent png file of the drawing as well for use on social media (Twitter, Twitch, Youtube), but it is not required.\n\nThank you very much!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/10Bs2QsrrBD0h7VrYBc2yZ-NnvQWxQIhK?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@syuu_NL/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ae71a462/uploads/origins/c26c83d2-da40-4e77-a373-83df74190588?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=66dbccbb206183599f6bdfdc6b58bc79", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ae71a462/uploads/origins/c26c83d2-da40-4e77-a373-83df74190588?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=66dbccbb206183599f6bdfdc6b58bc79, https://si.imgix.net/ae71a462/uploads/origins/c26c83d2-da40-4e77-a373-83df74190588?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9dd0949e5a1c8bca4e576085da946344 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ae71a462/uploads/origins/c26c83d2-da40-4e77-a373-83df74190588?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eba1d52e6fbd26a0274e38ccd817bdac 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、前回のリクエストのイラストがとても良かったです。またお願いしたいです。\n\n今回も衣装と構図はお任せします！\n\nもしよろしければ、SNSやTwitchに掲載させていただきます。ありがとうございました！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1OYj0HSSmT7K8wnJAPtUp1rbwe-YHp5uI?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@syuu_NL/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f0ab4d96/uploads/origins/224152fe-70b8-41f7-9ff9-